+ * @c data contains the delimiter:
+ * @code { 'a', 'b', ..., 'c', '\r', '\n', 'd', 'e', ... } @endcode
+ * The call to @c substr then extracts the data up to and including the
+ * delimiter, so that the string @c line contains:
+ * @code { 'a', 'b', ..., 'c', '\r', '\n' } @endcode
